From 55206c69e31b50f740d5d9b260afb52329293092 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Diagnostics <diag@friendplace.local>
Date: Mon, 24 Aug 2026 07:27:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] iter164o: Campaign Composer fixes (preview privacy, headline,
 signer, sign-off)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Five paired issues from the CMS Campaign Composer:

1. Preview privacy (Bug 1)
   Preview no longer peeks at the first real recipient. For a bulk
   audience the render override injects 'first_name = [Contact name]'
   so recipient names never leak (e.g. 'Dear Shelly,' on a 40-contact
   Outreach preview). Single-recipient campaigns still preview with
   the real recipient because that's the only person who'll receive
   the mail regardless.

2. Headline honesty (Bug 2)
   The composer's Headline field now stores the intended default
   'A note from FriendPlace' as an EDITABLE initial value rather than
   the renderer silently substituting it. Clearing the field genuinely
   means 'no headline' — the renderer omits the <h1> entirely.

3. Signed by (Bug 3)
   Expanded from {George, Georgia} to four options:
     • The FriendPlace Team  (default for Community/Outreach)
     • George                (default for Founding Member updates)
     • Georgia
     • No additional sign-off

4. One sign-off guarantee (Bug 4)
   Renderer-level fix (paired backend commit): a trailing sign-off
   block is stripped from body_md before the selected signer's closing
   is appended, so the pipeline emits exactly one closing regardless
   of what the author typed. The composer hint reflects the automatic
   behaviour rather than asking the user to remember 'No additional
   sign-off' as a workaround.

5. Correct outreach template (Bug 5)
   New UI-only template option 'Community / Outreach update' — maps to
   the same backend 'announcement' renderer but with team-signer
   default and no Founding-Member framing. Founder pill is naturally
   absent because outreach contacts carry no founder_number.

Scope discipline:
  Files touched (3):
    app/admin/campaigns/new/page.tsx   — composer changes
    app/admin/campaigns/[id]/page.tsx  — read-only label mapping
    lib/cms-api.ts                     — Campaign.companion type widen

  Not touched:
    - _resolve_audience / audience filtering / 40-contact count
    - _campaign_send_worker recipient personalisation
    - Save Draft / Schedule / Send Campaign endpoints
    - Flyer attachments
    - Founding-Member campaigns (regression verified: Founder pill,
      personal closing sentence, and George signature all unchanged)
    - marketing/send/page.tsx pre-existing type errors (separate task)

Backend paired changes live in cms_module.py and email_service.py:
  - campaigns_render_preview: placeholder for bulk, honest title
    pass-through, single-recipient real name kept
  - _campaign_send_worker: honest title pass-through
  - _letter_signature_html: 'none' signer support
  - announcement_template: conditional <h1>, team/none signer, and
    trailing-signoff stripper for one-signoff guarantee

Verification: 20/20 render probes pass, 48 campaign/email pytest tests
green, tsc/next build clean on this file set.
